; DCA_XAUUSD_v1 - Cau hinh AN TOAN HON de test lai (de xuat 2026-10-26)
; Dua tren bao cao ReportTester-374904993.xlsx thang 01/2026 (lo -86.972 USD, stop-out 28/01/2026)
; Load in MT5 Strategy Tester > Inputs > Load
; LUU Y: day la cau hinh DE TEST, khong phai bao dam co loi. Diem khac biet lon nhat so voi ban test cu:
; - Them stop cung: StopLoss 10% / 10.000 USD (ban cu de 0, khong co cat lo that)
; - Giam tong lot toi da moi chieu tu ~61 lot xuong ~1,38 lot
; - Hedge giam tu toi da 1,5 lot / 50 lenh xuong 0,2 lot / 5 lenh
; - Giu InpPipSize=1 nhu ban test cu (khong ve 0,1 cua ban repo): voi 0,1, khoang cach DCA chi 0,3-0,6 USD, bot se nhoi lenh qua nhanh
